# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. web-01.example.net runs Ubuntu$
# 26.04, whose time service is chrony. chrony is installed and$
# not running: a warning, and Set servers is unavailable. hardn$
# starts no time service.$
$
# NTP Settings #################################################$
$
  [ ] NTP                  Not Configured chrony not running$
$
  Time ---------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] Service              chrony not running$
  [ ] Clock                Not in sync$
   -  Server               1.ntp.ubuntu.com$
   -  Server               2.ntp.ubuntu.com$
   -  Server               3.ntp.ubuntu.com$
   -  Server               4.ntp.ubuntu.com$
   -  Server               ntp-bootstrap.ubuntu.com$
   -  hardn.yml            192.0.2.10, 192.0.2.11$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Set servers          chrony is not running$
                           [-] Unavailable$
$
   0) Return$
$
